  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction: <br>&bull; Product description:jnbkjkjn.jnjlnljhlkjnjknn,nnjn<br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): <br>&bull; Payment terms: kjhkjhjkkh<br>&bull; Other information:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">hjhnkujhjkhjjkkk</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">In Early 2021, buub was founded in Dubai by Reena Chavda, and later branched out internationally to the UK and beyond.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">Through her own personal wants and needs she longed for a solution to be able to wear plunging necklines and backless outfits without ugly bras on show.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">After trying many of the other &lsquo;solutions&rsquo; on the market and feeling very disheartened, Reena decided to develop her own range of tapes. For many years Reena, with her DD bust, struggled to wear clothes she saw her friends wearing so easily. She wanted to create a product that could allow women, of all shapes and sizes, to discreetly feel secure and confident.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">Reena used her time during the first Covid lockdown to contact different manufacturers. She tried and tested multiple tapes and then created her own product that superseded all others on the market. Finally Buub was born!</span></p>\r\n</div>",
